\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Per-head 2-bit quantization sensitivity across five architectures. Qwen2.5-7B shows high concentration in Layer-0 heads (``spread'' pattern); Yi-1.5-9B shows a single extreme outlier at Layer-4 Head-3 (``spike'' pattern); Llama-3.1-8B shows a dominant outlier at Layer-2 Head-5 (49\% of total distortion, ``spike'' pattern); Mistral-7B-v0.3 shows near-zero sensitivity across all heads; Gemma-2-9B exhibits the most uniform distribution, consistent with its low GQA ratio (2:1). Color intensity indicates PPL increase when the head is quantized to 2-bit.}}{13}{figure.caption.33}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:heatmap}{{4}{13}{Per-head 2-bit quantization sensitivity across five architectures. Qwen2.5-7B shows high concentration in Layer-0 heads (``spread'' pattern); Yi-1.5-9B shows a single extreme outlier at Layer-4 Head-3 (``spike'' pattern); Llama-3.1-8B shows a dominant outlier at Layer-2 Head-5 (49\% of total distortion, ``spike'' pattern); Mistral-7B-v0.3 shows near-zero sensitivity across all heads; Gemma-2-9B exhibits the most uniform distribution, consistent with its low GQA ratio (2:1). Color intensity indicates PPL increase when the head is quantized to 2-bit}{figure.caption.33}{}}
